 "text": "Looks like candy, right? It's beetroot. Plenty of people can't get past how beets taste. These are Horbach Beetroot+ Gummies, and they taste like strawberry. It's beetroot with nitrates, and the label calls it a nitric oxide precursor. They're vegan and gluten-free with no artificial sweeteners. It's a supplement, so if you take any medication, check with your doctor first. They've sold almost 85,000. It's in the orange cart below.",
